      "id": "k8-dream-compaction-veto",
      "impact": "additive",
      "summary": "K8 keeps a dream intent until its result syncs (#1490). botCompactVeto and the rule compactVeto now refuse a dream intent key with 'The dream result is not synced' until the sync closes that dream, so a compaction that names the key throws CompactVetoError and changes nothing. No Host code change: the caller retries after a later pass, as for a Turn K8 still reads.",
